  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RECLAIM Sustainability! Indonesia- Cotton &amp; Textiles</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to promote Fair value distribution in trade and supply chain of cotton and textiles industry especially in the traditional and SME market, conduct training and awareness raising in gender inclusivity, sustainable production and consumption, to negotiate with buyers/employers/brands for fair value/wages and rights and skilling gaps, better working conditions and environmentally safe practices and rights.</narrative>
  </description>
